         "prompt": "Use the average rate of change of \\( B \\) over the interval \\( 20 \\le t \\le 24 \\) to approximate \\( B'(22) \\), indicating units of measure. Using correct units, interpret the meaning of your approximation in the context of the problem.",
         "setup_required": false,
         "answer_latex": "-2.5 \\text{ feet per minute}",
